== 3. The confound's own premises ============================== 
  For the purity explanation to work, three things must hold: 
    (a) purity correlates NEGATIVELY with RASSF9 expression 
    (b) purity correlates POSITIVELY with global methylation 
    (c) global methylation correlates negatively with expression 
  If any fails, the confound cannot generate the observed pattern. 
 
    (a) CPE purity vs RASSF9 expression            n = 411  rho = -0.204  p = 3.05e-05 
    (a) CPE purity vs RASSF10 expression           n = 411  rho = +0.075  p = 0.130 
    (b) CPE purity vs global methylation           n = 411  rho = -0.033  p = 0.510 
    (c) global methylation vs RASSF9 expression    n = 469  rho = -0.030  p = 0.523 
    (c) global methylation vs RASSF10 expression   n = 469  rho = -0.032  p = 0.488 

